Rule 14 (shift value should be within the bounds of the axis dimension)
{a : tensor, shift : int, axis : int} |= shift < shape(a, axis)
>>
Rule 22 (shift can be a multiple of the axis dimension)
{a : tensor, shift : int, axis : int} |= shift % shape(a, axis) = 0
>>
Rule 43 (tensor dimensions should be non-negative)
{a : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(a) - 1] : shape(a, i) > 0
>>
Rule 45 (shift and axis should have the same sign)
{a : tensor, shift : int, axis : int} |= (shift ≥ 0 ∧ axis ≥ 0) ∨ (shift < 0 ∧ axis < 0)
>>
Rule 53 (shift should not be equal to axis length)
{a : tensor, shift : int, axis : int} |= shift ≠ shape(a, axis)
